values ($s$hustleclickgh$s$, $s$HustleClickGH$s$, $s$Ghana's AI dataset collection platform$s$, $s$Contributors record voice in English, Twi, Ga, Hausa and Dagbani, complete surveys and get paid by MTN MoMo or Telecel Cash. A built-in WebRTC dialer records conversations, and AI teams buy consented, compliant datasets.$s$, $s$## The brief

AI teams need high-quality speech and survey data in African languages. Many people in Ghana want flexible ways to earn. HustleClickGH connects the two in a single platform that pays contributors through Mobile Money.

## What we built

- A contributor web app with sign-up, a personal dashboard and guided tasks
- Voice recording in English, Twi, Ga, Hausa and Dagbani, exported as configurable WAV datasets (16 kHz or 48 kHz)
- A built-in WebRTC dialer for recording natural two-person conversations
- Survey data collection for research and product teams
- Mobile Money payouts through MTN MoMo and Telecel Cash
- Consent capture designed around Ghana's Data Protection Act, 2012
- A "For Companies" offering covering off-the-shelf datasets, annotation, transcription and translation

## The result

HustleClickGH has **1,450+ verified contributors** across **9 countries**, with consent recorded for every contribution.$s$, array[$s$Web app$s$, $s$AI data$s$, $s$Mobile money$s$]::text[], array[$s$ai$s$, $s$web$s$, $s$payments$s$]::text[], array[$s$custom-software$s$, $s$web-mobile-apps$s$]::text[], $s$1,450+$s$, $s$verified contributors$s$, $s$https://www.hustleclickgh.com/$s$, null, $s$/work/hustleclickgh-desktop.png$s$, $s$/work/hustleclickgh-mobile.png$s$, true, 0, true, $s$2026-11-06T21:18:16.736Z$s$)
