values ($s$nyansa-ai$s$, $s$Nyansa AI$s$, $s$Enterprise document intelligence with cited answers$s$, $s$Teams ask plain-English questions across contracts, reports and filings and get answers cited to the page and paragraph.$s$, $s$## The brief

Enterprise and compliance teams spend hours digging through contracts, reports and filings to answer simple questions. Generic AI chat tools can't be trusted with that work, because their answers can't be verified.

## What we built

- Plain-English questions across uploaded PDFs, reports and spreadsheets
- Every answer cited to the page, paragraph and source document
- An isolated, encrypted workspace for each organisation, on its own subdomain
- AES-256 encryption in transit and at rest
- Role-based access control built in from day one

## The result

Nyansa AI gives teams **document intelligence they can verify**. Every answer links straight back to its source, so it holds up to institutional scrutiny.$s$, array[$s$AI$s$, $s$SaaS$s$]::text[], array[$s$ai$s$, $s$web$s$]::text[], array[$s$ai-automation$s$, $s$custom-software$s$]::text[], $s$AES-256$s$, $s$isolated, encrypted workspace per org$s$, $s$https://nyansaai.com/$s$, null, $s$/work/nyansa-ai-desktop.png$s$, $s$/work/nyansa-ai-mobile.png$s$, true, 1, true, $s$2026-11-06T21:18:16.737Z$s$)
