values ($s$elsasu-rentals$s$, $s$Elsasu Rentals$s$, $s$Booking platform for chauffeur-driven group travel$s$, $s$Instant route quotes, MoMo and card checkout via Paystack, live trip tracking and a WhatsApp booking assistant.$s$, $s$## The brief

Group travel in Ghana, whether it's churches, weddings, funerals, tours, diaspora visits or staff shuttles, usually means phone calls, waiting and back-and-forth about price. Elsasu Rentals wanted customers to see a price and book in minutes.

## What we built

- A booking flow with instant quotes for airport transfers, half and full days, outstation trips, events and multi-day hires
- MoMo and card payments through Paystack, with a 30% deposit to confirm
- A live tracking link the whole group can follow
- A WhatsApp and on-site booking assistant for questions around the clock
- Fleet, destination and pricing pages that work beautifully on mobile

## The result

Customers see their exact price in seconds, with **no sign-up needed to get a quote**, and pay with the method they already use.$s$, array[$s$Web app$s$, $s$Payments$s$, $s$AI assistant$s$]::text[], array[$s$web$s$, $s$payments$s$, $s$automation$s$]::text[], array[$s$web-mobile-apps$s$, $s$ai-automation$s$]::text[], $s$Instant$s$, $s$quotes with MoMo & card checkout$s$, $s$https://www.elsasurentals.com/$s$, null, $s$/work/elsasu-rentals-desktop.png$s$, $s$/work/elsasu-rentals-mobile.png$s$, true, 2, true, $s$2026-11-06T21:18:16.737Z$s$)
