values ($s$pastcs$s$, $s$PastCS$s$, $s$Exam practice for University of Ghana CS students$s$, $s$Turns course outlines into real preparation: a growing question bank, timed mock exams and an AI tutor that explains mistakes.$s$, $s$## The brief

Computer Science students at the University of Ghana needed realistic exam practice tied to the courses they actually take, not generic question banks.

## What we built

- A question bank mapped to course outlines, now **1000+ questions** across 6+ courses
- Timed mock exams that simulate the real thing
- An AI tutor that explains what each student got wrong
- A personal dashboard with streaks, scores and course progress
- A leaderboard to keep practice social

## The result

**500+ students** use PastCS to practise, and it's free to start.$s$, array[$s$EdTech$s$, $s$AI tutor$s$, $s$Web app$s$]::text[], array[$s$education$s$, $s$ai$s$, $s$web$s$]::text[], array[$s$web-mobile-apps$s$, $s$custom-software$s$]::text[], $s$500+$s$, $s$students$s$, $s$https://www.pastcs.com/$s$, null, $s$/work/pastcs-desktop.png$s$, $s$/work/pastcs-mobile.png$s$, true, 3, true, $s$2026-11-06T21:18:16.737Z$s$)
