values ($s$whatsapp-ai-assistant$s$, $s$WhatsApp AI Bot$s$, $s$AI customer automation on WhatsApp$s$, $s$An AI assistant that answers customers, captures details and automates replies directly inside WhatsApp.$s$, $s$## The brief

Customers in Ghana message businesses on WhatsApp first. When those messages go unanswered after hours, the sale goes elsewhere.

## What we built

- An AI assistant that answers customer questions directly inside WhatsApp, 24/7
- Customer detail and request capture, so no lead slips through
- Automated replies for the routine questions your team answers every day

## Try it

Message the assistant on WhatsApp at [027 000 0004](https://wa.me/233270000004) and see how it handles your questions.$s$, array[$s$AI automation$s$, $s$WhatsApp$s$]::text[], array[$s$ai$s$, $s$automation$s$]::text[], array[$s$ai-automation$s$]::text[], null, null, $s$https://wa.me/233270000004$s$, $s$Try it on WhatsApp$s$, null, null, true, 4, true, $s$2026-11-06T21:18:16.737Z$s$)
